Scope of this licence
---------------------

This MIT licence covers the MATLAB scripts, Simulink models, documentation and
Python tooling written for this coursework by Ali Shavakhi.

It does **not** cover:

  - the laboratory assignment briefs, method handouts or any other document
    supplied by the course, authored by Riccardo Antonello and Francesco Ticozzi
    (Department of Information Engineering, University of Padova) — **none of
    those documents are redistributed in this repository**;

  - the Quanser SRV-02 hardware interface blocks (`SRV02IL_NIDAQ_block.slx`,
    `SRV02RL_NIDAQ_block.slx`, `balrob3d_block.slx`), which are third-party
    components of the laboratory setup and are **deliberately not included**;

  - the Quanser and Faulhaber product data the parameter files are built from.

Lab 2 was submitted jointly with Vaheid Labbaf, as recorded in the repository
README.
